  "notes_2024": "No edition dated mid-2024 is available (a Wayback capture of the PDF from 2024-04-23 exists but is truncated at 1 MB and unreadable). Fees derived from the 'EFF DATE' column, defined in the document as 'the effective date of the current TOTAL ALLOWABLE': a code is included only if its total allowable has an EFF DATE on or before 2024-07-01 in the current edition (AS OF 10/12/2026) or, failing that, in the 08/14/2025 edition. The oral-surgery codes D7140-D7250 carry EFF DATE 2026-10-01 in the current file but 2000-08-01/2003-06-01 in the 08/14/2025 file with the same totals (44.70, 61.21, 86.72, 112.22, 132.64, 153.04, 76.51), so they were in force on 2024-07-01. Source edition per code: {\"D0120\": \"2026-10\", \"D0140\": \"2026-10\", \"D0150\": \"2026-10\", \"D0210\": \"2026-10\", \"D0220\": \"2026-10\", \"D0274\": \"2026-10\", \"D0330\": \"2026-10\", \"D1110\": \"2026-10\", \"D1120\": \"2026-10\", \"D1206\": \"2026-10\", \"D1351\": \"2026-10\", \"D2140\": \"2026-10\", \"D2150\": \"2026-10\", \"D2391\": \"2026-10\", \"D2392\": \"2026-10\", \"D2393\": \"2026-10\", \"D2394\": \"2026-10\", \"D2740\": \"2026-10\", \"D2750\": \"2026-10\", \"D2751\": \"2026-10\", \"D2752\": \"2026-10\", \"D2790\": \"2026-10\", \"D2930\": \"2026-10\", \"D2950\": \"2026-10\", \"D2962\": \"2026-10\", \"D3220\": \"2026-10\", \"D3310\": \"2026-10\", \"D3320\": \"2026-10\", \"D3330\": \"2026-10\", \"D3346\": \"2026-10\", \"D3347\": \"2026-10\", \"D3348\": \"2026-10\", \"D4341\": \"2026-10\", \"D4342\": \"2026-10\", \"D4355\": \"2026-10\", \"D4910\": \"2026-10\", \"D5110\": \"2026-10\", \"D5120\": \"2026-10\", \"D5211\": \"2026-10\", \"D5212\": \"2026-10\", \"D5213\": \"2026-10\", \"D5214\": \"2026-10\", \"D5225\": \"2026-10\", \"D5226\": \"2026-10\", \"D5820\": \"2026-10\", \"D5821\": \"2026-10\", \"D6056\": \"2026-10\", \"D6057\": \"2026-10\", \"D6058\": \"2026-10\", \"D6059\": \"2026-10\", \"D6065\": \"2026-10\", \"D6066\": \"2026-10\", \"D6240\": \"2026-10\", \"D6245\": \"2026-10\", \"D6750\": \"2026-10\", \"D6740\": \"2026-10\", \"D6790\": \"2026-10\", \"D7140\": \"2025-08\", \"D7210\": \"2025-08\", \"D7220\": \"2025-08\", \"D7230\": \"2025-08\", \"D7240\": \"2025-08\", \"D7241\": \"2025-08\", \"D7250\": \"2025-08\", \"D7953\": \"2026-10\", \"D8070\": \"2026-10\", \"D8080\": \"2026-10\", \"D8090\": \"2026-10\", \"D8670\": \"2026-10\", \"D8680\": \"2026-10\", \"D9222\": \"2026-10\", \"D9223\": \"2026-10\", \"D9239\": \"2026-10\", \"D9243\": \"2026-10\", \"D9230\": \"2026-10\"}. Not determinable: D6010 (D6010 total effective 2025-01-01 and by-report anyway). Base amounts only. +98% add-on: the header 'For all dental services provided on or after 01/01/22, an additional 98% must be added to the fee schedule total amount' appears identically in the 08/14/2025 and 10/12/2026 editions, and the MHCP Provider Manual 'Payment Methodology - Non-Hospital' page lists '98 percent for dental services MA and MinnesotaCare members (January 2022)', so the add-on applied in 2024 (payment approx. base x 1.98). D8070/D8080/D8090 = 73.09 each (FACT CODE 1, eff 2000-01-01): the fee schedule does not state the unit basis (per visit/month/case); the MHCP dental manual pages are behind a bot-protection captcha and could not be checked, so this is UNVERIFIED - 73.09 is clearly not a full-case comprehensive orthodontic fee."
